factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 4 problems
  The reel_script says Thaniarasu gave the interview on 'நவம்பர் 16ஆம் தேதி' (November 16); the article says 'இன்று (நவ.,16)', which matches, so no issue there — however the reel_script omits the fact that the Vijay government (த.வெ.க. அரசு) is the target of his criticism, which is a key claim of the article.
  The reel_script and caption state that the Chief Minister is silent on the Mekedatu dam issue and that the government is going backward; the article's claim that Vijay's government is moving 'பின்நோக்கி' (backward) and that Vijay should act as a full-fledged CM is only partially reflected, and the criticism that the government lacks proper administration is not included in the reel_script.
  The reel_script says the Kallakurichi MLA sent 'தவறான தகவல்' to the collector, and that the National Women's Commission 'தாமாக முன்வந்து நடவடிக்கை எடுக்க உத்தரவிட்டுள்ளது' — the article says this happened because no action was taken, which the reel_script states only as 'அதன் மீது நடவடிக்கை இல்லாததால்'; the claim that the collector also faces an unsafe environment is omitted.
  The caption's 'மக்கள் கவனத்திற்கு' line adds a claim that is not in the article's framing, and the slide 'அரோகரா முழக்கம் குறித்து கண்டனம்' misstates the article, which says saying 'அரோகரா' to Vijay is condemnable, not a 'முழக்கம்' (slogan) about a general matter.
