  reel_script and caption claim the Kallakurichi MLA issue 'தேசிய மகளிர் ஆணையம் தாமாக முன்வந்து நடவடிக்கை எடுக்க உத்தரவிட்டுள்ளது' – the article says the NCW ordered action because of this, but the draft merges two facts into one causal chain without clarifying the ordering, and the caption repeats this as a standalone fact
  reel_script omits the article's statement that the Tamil Nadu government (Vijay government) is not improving administration and is going backwards, and omits the Mekedatu dam remark – important points of the article are missing
  reel_script omits the article's claim that 'விஜய் முழுமையான முதல்வராக செயல்பட வேண்டும்' – a key political point of the interview is missing
